<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index fell nine points to 1,353.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index fell nine points to 1,353.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates fell to 1,353 today from 1,362 on July 21, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
